10:T8c8,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"CreativeWork","name":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』虚伝 燃ゆる本能寺 〜再演〜","description":"2016年5月の初演からわずか半年、圧倒的な熱望に応えて上演された再演。織田信長を元の主とする刀剣男士たちの葛藤を描いた物語はそのままに、一部キャストの変更や演出の細かなブラッシュアップを経て、さらに深みを増した。初演が「刀ステ」の誕生だとしたら、この再演はシリーズとしての不動の地位を確立させた一作。ラストの軍議シーンでのアドリブ（日替わり軍議）も、この頃からファンの楽しみとして定着していった。","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/plays/touken-ranbu-stage-kyoden-saien","keywords":"殺陣厚め, 世界観つよめ, エモい, ゲーム原作","about":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』（刀ステ）","actor":[{"@type":"Person","name":"鈴木 拡樹","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/suzuki-hiroki"},{"@type":"Person","name":"荒牧 慶彦","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/aramaki-yoshihiko"},{"@type":"Person","name":"佐々木 喜英","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/sasaki-yoshihide"},{"@type":"Person","name":"瀬戸 祐介","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/seto-yusuke"},{"@type":"Person","name":"納谷 健","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/naya-takeru"},{"@type":"Person","name":"北村 諒","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kitamura-ryo"},{"@type":"Person","name":"和田 雅成","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/wada-masanari"},{"@type":"Person","name":"椎名 鯛造","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/shiina-taizo"},{"@type":"Person","name":"廣瀬 大介","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/hirose-daisuke"},{"@type":"Person","name":"杉江 大志","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/sugie-taishi"},{"@type":"Person","name":"東 啓介","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/higashi-keisuke"},{"@type":"Person","name":"健人","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kento"},{"@type":"Person","name":"丸目 聖人","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/marume-kiyohito"},{"@type":"Person","name":"窪寺 昭","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kubodera-akira"}]}5:["$","main",null,{"className":"container","style":{"paddingBlock":32},"children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$10"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"stack-lg","children":[["$","section",null,{"className":"hero-card stack-md","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span"